# Sherin Web UI

Use **lucide-react** for all icons and **shadcn/ui** (`@/components/ui/*`) for interactive UI.

## Icons (lucide-react)

- Import named icons from `lucide-react` only — no other icon libraries, inline SVGs, or emoji as UI icons.
- Page headers: pass `icon` to `PageHeader` (e.g. `Store`, `Users`, `Package`, `Receipt`).
- Actions: pair icons with shadcn `Button` / `NavLink` — `Plus` create, `Pencil` edit, `Search` search, `X` cancel.
- Card section titles: `CardTitle` with `className="flex items-center gap-2"` + icon (`size-4` or `size-5 text-primary`).
- Sidebar nav icons live in `lib/nav-config.ts` as `LucideIcon` types.

## Components (shadcn/ui)

- Use existing primitives: `Button`, `Input`, `Label`, `Select`, `Card`, `Table`, `Alert`, `Badge`, `Skeleton`, `NavLink`, etc.
- Do not use raw `<button>`, `<table>`, or unstyled `<input>` in app pages (print-only views may use minimal markup).
- Add missing shadcn components via the project CLI before building custom widgets.
- Match patterns from `employer/page.tsx` and `admin/page.tsx`.

## Example

```tsx
import { Package, Plus, Pencil } from "lucide-react";
import { PageHeader } from "@/components/layout/page-header";
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { Card, CardHeader, CardTitle } from "@/components/ui/card";

<PageHeader icon={Package} title={t("employer.products.title")} description="..." />
<CardHeader>
  <CardTitle className="flex items-center gap-2">
    <Plus className="size-4 text-primary" />
    {t("employer.products.createTitle")}
  </CardTitle>
</CardHeader>
<Button type="button" size="sm" variant="outline">
  <Pencil />
  {t("common.edit")}
</Button>
```
